{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Praise the LORD
Praise God in his [Bb]sanc[Eb]tuary
Praise him in his mighty heav[Bb]ens
[Eb]Praise him for his powerful [Bb]deeds
[Eb]Praise him for his surpassing great[Bb]ness
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Praise him with the blast of the ram's [Bb]horn
[Eb]Praise him with harp and [Bb]lyre
[Eb]Praise him with tambourine and danc[Bb]ing
[Ab]Praise him with strings and pipe
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Praise him with ringing cymbals
[Eb]Praise him with crashing cym[Bb]bals
{end_of_verse}

